  "description": "<p>超市結帳時，收銀機把每件商品的價格一筆一筆加起來，最後輸出應付金額——這就是累加器的實際應用。</p><p>請寫一個程式，第一行輸入商品件數 <code>N</code>，接著輸入 <code>N</code> 行，每行一個整數（商品金額），輸出所有金額的總和。</p>",
  "inputFormat": "<p>第一行為正整數 <code>N</code>；接下來 N 行，每行一個整數（金額）。</p>",
  "outputFormat": "<p>一行，輸出所有金額的總和。</p>",
  "constraints": "<ul><li>1 ≤ N ≤ 20</li><li>-1000 ≤ 每筆金額 ≤ 1000</li></ul>",
  "timeLimit": 1,
  "memoryLimit": 256,
  "sampleInput": "3\n10\n20\n30",
  "sampleOutput": "60",
  "testCases": [
    {
      "input": "3\n10\n20\n30",
      "output": "60"
    },
    {
      "input": "5\n10\n20\n30\n40\n50",
      "output": "150"
    },
    {
      "input": "1\n0",
      "output": "0"
    },
    {
      "input": "1\n100",
      "output": "100"
    },
    {
      "input": "4\n5\n5\n5\n5",
      "output": "20"
    },
    {
      "input": "3\n0\n0\n0",
      "output": "0"
    },
    {
      "input": "6\n1\n2\n3\n4\n5\n6",
      "output": "21"
    },
    {
      "input": "2\n50\n50",
      "output": "100"
    },
    {
      "input": "3\n100\n200\n300",
      "output": "600"
    },
    {
      "input": "4\n-1\n-2\n-3\n-4",
      "output": "-10"
    }
  ]
